@startuml
title Bonecutters Tools
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "run-verification.mjs" as Verification
component "test-client.mjs" as ClientTests
component "validate-deployment-config.mjs" as DeploymentConfig
component "aws-lane.mjs" as AwsLane
component "deploy-aws.mjs" as DeployAws
database ".local/aws-project.json\n(ignored)" as LocalConfig
component "AWS CLI\n(human-approved)" as AwsCli

Verification --> ClientTests : runs test gate
Verification --> DeploymentConfig : runs deployment-config gate
AwsLane --> LocalConfig : reads local lane values
AwsLane --> AwsCli : identity checks by profile
DeployAws --> LocalConfig : reads deploy lane
DeployAws --> AwsCli : uploads and invalidates

note right of LocalConfig
Contains real local AWS values.
Ignored by Git and never committed.
end note

@enduml
